{# ===========================================================================
   Component: the order close on a location page

   Section 7 of the location page template: this kitchen's own Toast URL, from
   locations.json, click-tested for all seven on 2026-08-05.

   WHY IT IS A COMPONENT, 2026-09-14. It existed on exactly one page
   (/tajima-college-heights/) and the other six closed on the noodle statement
   instead, which meant the page whose job is "send someone to this room"
   ended without an order action. The noodle statement came off the location
   pages in the same pass: it already carries /about/ and /locations/, and
   stacking two headline-plus-button units at the foot of every location page
   made both of them read as boilerplate. Ordering is this page's real job, so
   it is what closes.

   The noodle line is NOT gone from the site. It is the statement moment on
   /about/ and on /locations/, where it is the only one. See DESIGN_SYSTEM.md.

   NO NEAREST-NEIGHBOUR LINK. The close routes to /locations/ rather than
   naming another room: linking all six from every location page is how six
   pages become one undifferentiated blob to a crawler. Convoy and Mercury are
   the exception and already carry a deliberate, mutual "the other Kearny Mesa
   room" section higher up the page.

   ONE PRIMARY CTA PER VIEWPORT. The header's Order Online pill is the other
   red on the page and it is a screen away by the time anyone reaches this.
   =========================================================================== #}
{%- if loc.orderUrl %}
<section class="sect sect--alt sect--rule" aria-labelledby="order-title">
  <div class="sect__inner">
    <header class="sect__head">
      <h2 class="sect__title" id="order-title">Order from <em>this kitchen.</em></h2>
      <p class="sect__note">
        {#
          Maui is 2,500 miles from the San Diego set and its brief forbids
          cross-linking it into them, so it closes on the menu instead of on
          the other rooms.
        #}
        Straight through to the {{ loc.name }} order page.
        {% if loc.region == "san-diego" %}Or see <a class="sect__link" href="/locations/">all six San Diego rooms</a>.{% else %}Or see <a class="sect__link" href="#menu">what comes out of this kitchen</a>.{% endif %}
      </p>
    </header>
    <a class="noodle-band__cta" href="{{ loc.orderUrl }}" rel="noopener">
      Order from {{ loc.name }}
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M1 7H13M13 7L7.5 1.5M13 7L7.5 12.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif %}
